# shell: desktop
# home: fixture
# prefs: factory
# A folder that IS a project says so in the panel: it wears the
# developer's folder -- the badge at its corner -- while a plain folder
# beside it stays plain.  And Open Project… offers only what it can
# take: a file that is not a project.tiku shows greyed and refuses the
# pick, while the folders stay the roads they are.
wait 25
click 980 30
wait 4
menu-pick Programming
wait 4
menu-pick TikuBasic
wait 150
click 71 8
wait 8
menu-pick Open Project…
wait 40
expect-title Open
expect-pixel 294 204 d11c1c
expect-pixel 294 224 2b2b2b
expect-pixel 330 218 000000
expect-pixel 317 238 8c8c8c
click 400 240
wait 6
click 675 413
wait 30
expect-title Open
click 400 200
wait 6
key Return
wait 30
click 400 220
wait 6
click 675 413
wait 60
expect-no-title Open
quit
